From c56360d2653be93a34e16e0e28bcc03303b500bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kernel <kernel@local>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:57:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] ik2: exact verify window register kernels for gfx1100
 (IK2_K_WEXP/WMVF16/WROUTE/WCOMB/WACOMB, default off, same bits)

- IK2_K_WEXP: experts_win_gu/_down - NVFP4, Q8_0, Q4_K gate/up; NVFP4, Q8_0, Q5_0 down:
  a row's words read once (NT per IK2_HIP_NT bit 1 / bit 8) into registers for all group members,
  each member summed in row_dot/row_dot_2's order (the token kernels' bits)
- IK2_K_WMVF16: window FP16 rows (router, dyn taps) and prep_*_block sinks through f16_dot_lane
- IK2_K_WROUTE: router rows + route_rows + group_route in one launch (last-block counter)
- IK2_K_WCOMB: moe_combine_f32 + conv_block in one launch (block 32 ch x T tokens, shared sums)
- IK2_K_WACOMB: toks attention combine with IK2_HIP_COMB's B=32 partial loads
- q8_blk0/1 dot, route_rows_kernel, group_route_kernel bodies factored into shared device functions
- tests: test_window_k (+ WACOMB case in the toks attention test)
